(131, 'marketing_service.element', '{\"has_image\":[\"1\"],\"title\":\"Project Corporate identity\",\"title_ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0624\\u0633\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0639\",\"description\":\"<ol style=\\\"font-family:Inter, sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;color:rgb(66,66,66);\\\"><li>Sponsored Ads With daily follow-up and the possibility of amending the advertisement if necessary, while ensuring that the maximum desired results are achieved<\\/li><li>Content marketing Marketing all of the videos, designs, ideas, writings, or articles and special topics that you seek to reach people<\\/li><li>Writing marketing content Including marketing writing, taking into account the possibility of appearing in the search with the use of creative marketing words<\\/li><li>Page management c Make complete settings for the page, including adding the appropriate buttons to the page, linking the page on Instagram and WhatsApp, and linking them All in the Business Manager and achieving a large page growth rate, daily publishing for a month<\\/li><li>Create a comprehensive marketing plan for the project or commercial activity.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"description_ar\":\"<div>\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u0646\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0645\\u0648\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u064a\\u0648\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0625\\u0645\\u0643\\u0627\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0639\\u062f\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0625\\u0630\\u0627 \\u0644\\u0632\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0636\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0623\\u0642\\u0635\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u062c\\u0648\\u0629<\\/div><div>\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0633\\u0648\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062d\\u