(207, 'policy_pages.element', '{\"title\":\"Terms of Use\",\"details\":\"<div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>Terms of use<\\/div><div>By agreeing to use the site\'s services, you must comply with the following:<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- Not to advertise or upload content or items that are inappropriate for the ratings available on the site that are allowed to be sold. You should review the advertising terms.<\\/div><div>- Not to violate or circumvent the laws, policies and regulations of the site or any rights related to a third party.<\\/div><div>- Not to copy the advertisement from property incubator website and publish it on other sites.<\\/div><div>- Not to use any illegal means to access advertisements or other users\' data, to violate the policy and rights of property incubator, to access the content of the site, or to collect and collect information and data related to property incubator or the customers of the site, and to benefit from it in any way or republish it.<\\/div><div>- Not to violate the restrictions on the site or the application, or to bypass or circumvent the breach of other measures used with the aim of preventing or restricting access to this site<\\/div><div>- Not to use our services if you are not legally qualified to complete this agreement, for example that you are under 18 years of age or you are temporarily or permanently blocked from using the site.<\\/div><div>- Not to manipulate prices, whether in buying or selling, and causing harm to other customers.<\\/div><div>- Not to publish fake or speculative advertisements or false, inaccurate, misleading, deceptive, defamatory, or libelous comments, and Property Incubator website may cancel, without prior notice, all unreal advertisements.<\\/div><div>- Not to take any action based on the opinions and evaluation of customers or depart from the content of the advertisement.<\\/div><div>- Not to be exposed to international policies, sovereignties, dignitaries, or any discussions that are not related to legitimate buying and selling in property incubator.<\\/div><div>- Not to post, distribute or upload any defamatory, offensive, infringing, harmful, threatening, abusive, tortuous, racist, morally inappropriate or otherwise unlawful content or information<\\/div><div>- Not to forge any file attached to property incubator website.<\\/div><div>- Not to copy the advertiser\'s right to any advertisement that has been added.<\\/div><div>- Do not transfer your account or activity to other sites while carrying our logo or services.<\\/div><div>- Not to violate copyrights, trademarks, patents, advertising, databases or other property or intellectual rights belonging to property incubator or licensed to the property incubator.<\\/div><div>- Not to violate others\' property, intellectual or patent rights.<\\/div><div>- Not to collect information about other site users for commercial or other purposes.<\\/div><div>- Not to do anything that might harm the reputation of property incubator<\\/div><div>- Not to impersonate property custodian, representative or employee, or any capacity suggesting that you are affiliated with the company, unless you have official permission from the company.<\\/div><div>- Not to obtain or attempt to obtain unauthorized access to the site or any account of a member on the site, or to impersonate any person or misrepresent the membership with another person.<\\/div><div>- Not to use any automated device, software or means to access, retrieve, copy or index the Application and\\/or our website or any content on our website.<\\/div><div>- Not to perform any action that imposes any burden or causes an increase in traffic demands on our infrastructure in the way that we deem - in our sole discretion - to use the Site as unreasonable or inappropriate.<\\/div>\",\"details_ar\":\"<span>\\u0628\\u0645\\u0648\\u0627\\u0641\\u0642\\u062a\\u0643 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0641\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 