(208, 'policy_pages.element', '{\"title\":\"Terms\\u00a0and\\u00a0conditions\",\"details\":\"<div>Terms and conditions of property incubator<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- The following are the terms and policies of property incubator platform that govern your access and use of the platform\'s services on the electronic domain www.amlakin.com,<\\/div><div>- Please read these terms along with the privacy policy very carefully before you start using the services of property incubator platform to ensure that you understand all its provisions, as it explains all the services provided by the platform, and contains important information related to your legal rights and obligations.<\\/div><div>These conditions aim to regulate the process of providing the platform with its services as an investment portfolio for partners by presenting and managing opportunities for commercial properties.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- Property incubator platform provides a set of services for owners and managers of commercial properties (towers, commercial complexes, hotels, factories, etc.).<\\/div><div>- Property management service<\\/div><div>- The service of buying or selling property: through which the property is offered for sale in a specific period and all the details related to it that the investor needs to make his investment decision are published.<\\/div><div>- Giving qualified real estate brokers and marketers the opportunity to conclude deals through the platform<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- User must comply with all applicable laws, regulations, regulations and rules in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia<\\/div><div>- User should have the legal capacity to conclude contracts<\\/div><div>In order to access and use the platform\\u2019s services, the user must register an account and provide all required data and information, provided that this data is true, accurate, and complete, free from fraud, and be careful when filling out the registration fields, and bear responsibility for any errors in it.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- To benefit from property management service on the platform, an agreement is made on the services to be provided between the property owners and the platform, and a contract is signed between the two parties that includes the rights and obligations of each party<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- Owners or property managers must, before selling any property, evaluate the property by an accredited valuer<\\/div><div>- The resident must have a license approved by the Saudi Authority for Accredited Residents in the Kingdom<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- The seller and the buyer bear all real estate fees and taxes in accordance with the regulations in force in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- Property incubator has the right to cancel the membership of any user in the event of a violation of any of the provisions of these conditions, or a breach of the obligations of any user in the agreements or contracts that he concludes with the platform<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- The property owner guarantees the integrity of his ownership of the property and the validity, accuracy, legality and integrity of the documents proving ownership of the property without any legal responsibility on the platform.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- The privacy and confidentiality of information document has been prepared to help visitors and users understand the nature of the data collected from them when visiting the site and how to deal with it. property incubator takes appropriate procedures and measures to maintain personal information in a secure manner that guarantees protection from loss, unauthorized access, misuse, or unauthorized modification and disclosure.<\\/div><div>Among the most important measures in place to protect visitor personal information:<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Contact us immediately when you think someone has obtained your password, usage code, password, or any other confidential information.<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Regular and periodic updating of protection procedures and controls that meet or exceed standard standards.<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Our staff are qualified and trained to respect the confidentiality of our visitors\' personal information.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- We collect and use information about you to run our business and to provide you with better services. This information is collected from multiple sources such as various service request forms, and any information that appears on the written or electronic means of communication that take place between us, such as name, address, personal identification document number, profession and any other data that is provided to us. If you send us an e-mail to the site providing us with your personal data, we may share the necessary data with other parties or departments, in order to serve you more effectively. We will not share your personal data with non-governmental entities unless they are authorized by the competent authorities to perform specific government services. By submitting your personal data and information through the site, you fully agree to the storage, processing and use of that data by Property Incubator.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>Protect your privacy<\\/div><div>In order for us to help you protect your personal information, we recommend the following:<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Contact us immediately when you think someone has obtained your password, usage code, password, or any other confidential information.<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Do not give out confidential information over the phone or the Internet unless you know the identity of the person or party receiving the information.<\\/div><div>\\u2022 Use a secure browser when performing online transactions, close unused applications on the network, and make sure your antivirus software is always up to date.<\\/div><div>\\u2022 To safeguard your personal data, electronic storage and transmitted personal data are secured using appropriate security technologies.<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>Sending e-mails to property incubator<\\/div><div>When you inquire or request information about a specific product or service, or if you give additional information using any of the means of communication with property incubator, whether electronic or non-electronic, such as an inquiry request on our website, we will use your email address to respond to your inquiries, and it is also possible to save your mail address and your message and our answer to it for quality control purposes, and we may do so for legal and regulatory purposes.<\\/div>\",\"details_ar\":\"<div style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><div>\\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0637 \\u0648\\u0623\\u062d\\u0643\\u0627\\u0645 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0636\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u0643<\\/div><div><br \\/><\\/div><div>- \\u0641\\u064a\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0644\\u064a \\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0637 \\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0627\\u0633\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0646\\u0635\\u0651\\u0629 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0636\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u0643 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u062d\\u0643\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0635\\u0648\\u0644\\u0643 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645\\u0643 \\u0644\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0635\\u0651\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0637\\u0627\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0644\\u0643\\u062a\\u0631\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a www.amlakin.com \\u060c\\u00a0<\\/div><div>- \\u064a\\u0631\\u062c\\u0649 \\u0642\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621\\u0629 \\u0647\\u0630\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0637 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062c\\u0627\\u0646\\u0628 \\u0633\\u064a\\u0627\\u0633\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0635\\u